# title: Atlas
# category: Multi-asset
# underlyings: 4
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: A call on a four-stock basket from which the best and the worst performers are removed at maturity.
# param: notional = 1000 | amount | Notional
# param: strike = 1.0 | percent | Strike on the middle basket
#
# The basket is the average of the two middle performers.

2027-01-04
    notional = 1000
    strike = 1.0
    s0 = spot(0)
    s1 = spot(1)
    s2 = spot(2)
    s3 = spot(3)

2028-01-04
    p0 = spot(0) / s0
    p1 = spot(1) / s1
    p2 = spot(2) / s2
    p3 = spot(3) / s3
    best = max(max(p0, p1), max(p2, p3))
    worst = min(min(p0, p1), min(p2, p3))
    middle = (p0 + p1 + p2 + p3 - best - worst) / 2
    pays notional * max(middle - strike, 0)
